Subject: [PATCH 4/6] refactor(likelihood): extract seasonal_time_integral (eq.
 26 via the eq. 25 overlap matrix; signature includes f_a per review -- the W
 @ exp(f_a) contraction is the point of the exact integral) and rewire BOTH
 spatiotemporal_hawkes_model and spatiotemporal_LGCP_model onto it,
 deduplicating the previously copy-pasted block. Returns (seasonal_mass,
 total): the per-cell mass still feeds the rate_time diagnostic at the model
 layer and will feed the _sim_cox normalizer in Phase 2b, making (I1)
 structural. Unit test: independent float64 NumPy reference; finite gradients
 w.r.t. (a_0, f_t, f_a). Pure lift, op order preserved: value AND gradient
 pins bit-identical; 30/30.

---
 bstpp/inference_functions.py   | 15 ++++++++-------
 bstpp/likelihood.py            | 21 +++++++++++++++++++++
 tests/test_likelihood_atoms.py | 24 +++++++++++++++++++++++-
 3 files changed, 52 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

